<view class="page home">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="badge">✨ 好友年报 · 2026</view>
    <view class="hero-title">
      <view>把聊天记录</view>
      <view>变成年度报告</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hero-sub">
      <view>谁更话痨？几点最活跃？</view>
      <view>年度称号又花落谁家？</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hero-deco">📊 💬 🌙</view>
  </view>

  <view class="mode-card" hover-class="mode-card-hover" bindtap="goImport">
    <view class="mode-icon">📂</view>
    <view class="mode-body">
      <view class="mode-title">导入聊天记录</view>
      <view class="mode-desc">粘贴或选择微信导出的聊天记录文件，生成真实数据报告</view>
    </view>
    <view class="arrow">›</view>
  </view>

  <view class="mode-card" hover-class="mode-card-hover" bindtap="goQuiz">
    <view class="mode-icon">📝</view>
    <view class="mode-body">
      <view class="mode-title">手填问答</view>
      <view class="mode-desc">没有聊天记录？回答几个问题，生成趣味版报告</view>
    </view>
    <view class="arrow">›</view>
  </view>

  <view class="privacy">
    🔒 所有分析都在手机本地完成，聊天内容不会被上传到任何服务器，请放心使用。
  </view>
</view>
